bio:

John is a software engineer working in Vancouver, Canada. He primary works on backend services in Python these days, but started out in embedded firmware, with forays into developer tooling, operating systems, and game development. 

Outside of his work, John likes hiking in nature and playing video games and board games with friends and family.
